{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123886","id":4654328569,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFWtq-Q","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123886","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123886.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123886.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123886","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123886/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/123886/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123886/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/8082b893d8c687384a80cf7bc201aa2bd932e5e5","number":123886,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[3.x] Limit editor selection for `NodePath` export hint","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Supersedes #39155\r\n\r\nAdds export hints for `NodePaths`, e.g.:\r\n```\r\nexport(NodePath, Button) var my_node_path\r\n```\r\n<img width=\"405\" height=\"365\" alt=\"83309412-7afc9380-a209-11ea-9a14-8d3e304f1d3b\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dfc97b88-4386-4a1b-af12-fdd67986d0c0\" />\r\n\r\nThe filter now shows up in the tree view when you click to assign nodes.\r\nAlso works for custom classes deriving from `Node`.\r\n\r\n.....\r\n\r\nHad a little look at this as that PR did have some demand (and testing).\r\nThis PR adds some bug fixes / robustness since the original, but will still need testing a decent testing in one of the dev builds, as the editor environment can be complex, and I'm not an editor specialist.\r\n\r\n## Changes from #39155\r\n### Ref<Script> access\r\nThe original PR accessed the script object indirectly by calling `p_node->get_script_instance()`.\r\nHere `p_node->get_script()` is called directly. While script instances _do_ seem to be created for non-tool scripts in the editor in 3.x, bypassing the instance layer should be a safer policy as it protects against e.g. the case of compilation errors that cause the runtime instance to break.\r\n\r\n### Scene Tree Performance\r\nWe don't want this new code to negatively affect editor display performance.\r\n\r\n* Removed recursive string comparisons.\r\n* Scoped caching in `_update_tree()`. Resource paths are resolved once via `ResourceLoader::load()` before the recursion. References are released at the end of `_update_tree()` to avoid hanging onto `Scripts` and affecting their lifetimes (which could cause knock on issues).\r\n* Using `StringName` rather than `String` to avoid `String` allocations.\r\n\r\n### inherits_script()\r\nThis PR uses the `inherits_script()` function (which works for difference languages) instead of the custom loop in the original PR (not even sure it existed when it was written).\r\n\r\n### Supports scripts that inherit from scripts\r\nNested scripts would have failed with the original PR, resulting in the error \"does not inherit from Node\". Now these are handled.\r\n\r\n## Notes\r\nI've opted not to add support for multiple hints (e.g. a `NodePath` that can either be a `Sprite` or a `Button`, e.g. `export(NodePath, Button, Sprite) var my_node_path`), but it would be a possible addition in the future.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":11568492,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AsIVs","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/21","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/21","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/21/labels","number":21,"state":"open","title":"3.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/receiv